<title>HONG KONG: Frankie Dominion 1996 net down 71.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Frankie Dominion 1996 net down 71.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   4.1	vs  15.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.0	vs  7.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs  34.10 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    13.84    vs  48.39</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,031.90 vs  1,132.68</p>
<p>    Company name		 Frankie Dominion International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 8-14</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 14</p>
<p>NOTE - Frankie Dominion is a household products maker.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is four H.K. cents (including interim dividend of one cent) vs 10 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
